---
import { siCaddy, siCloudflare, siDocker, siGithub, siGo, siLinux, siPostgresql } from "simple-icons";
---
<section class="blueprint" aria-labelledby="architecture-title">
  <div class="blueprint-head">
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow">ARCHITECTURE / SINGLE HOST</span>
      <h2 id="architecture-title">What runs on your server.</h2>
    </div>
    <p>MyPaaS is a focused control plane on one Linux host. GitHub feeds deployments, Cloudflare + Caddy publish traffic, and the Go API controls runtime state, routing, telemetry, databases, and automation.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="diagram" role="img" aria-label="MyPaaS single-host architecture with GitHub source, Cloudflare and Caddy ingress, Go API control plane, PostgreSQL state, Docker-compatible runtime, mypaas-statd, containers, static releases, and CLI API MCP automation surfaces.">
    <div class="external-row">
      <div class="node external" style={`--brand:#${siGithub.hex}`}><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d={siGithub.path}/></svg><div><span>SOURCE</span><strong>GitHub</strong><small>OAuth · repository · webhooks</small></div></div>
      <div class="wire-label">deploy</div>
      <div class="node external" style={`--brand:#${siCloudflare.hex}`}><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d={siCloudflare.path}/></svg><div><span>PUBLIC EDGE</span><strong>Cloudflare</strong><small>Tunnel · TLS · optional analytics</small></div></div>
    </div>

    <div class="control-grid">
      <div class="node panel"><span>UI</span><strong>Dashboard</strong><small>SvelteKit operator interface</small></div>
      <div class="node panel primary"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d={siGo.path}/></svg><span>CONTROL</span><strong>Go API</strong><small>deploy · route · recover · automate</small></div>
      <div class="node panel" style={`--brand:#${siPostgresql.hex}`}><svg class="brand-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d={siPostgresql.path}/></svg><span>STATE</span><strong>PostgreSQL</strong><small>platform state + optional shared DB</small></div>
      <div class="node automation"><span>AUTOMATION SURFACES</span><strong>CLI · API · MCP</strong><small>scripts, operators, and MCP-compatible agents use the same platform API</small></div>
      <div class="node ingress" style={`--brand:#${siCaddy.hex}`}><svg class="brand-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d={siCaddy.path}/></svg><span>ROUTING</span><strong>Caddy</strong><small>dashboard · API · project routes · static files</small></div>
    </div>

    <div class="host-shell">
      <div class="host-title"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d={siLinux.path}/></svg><div><span>LINUX HOST</span><strong>single VM / bare metal</strong></div></div>
      <div class="runtime-grid">
        <div class="runtime-box" style={`--brand:#${siDocker.hex}`}><div class="runtime-title"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d={siDocker.path}/></svg><strong>Docker-compatible runtime</strong></div><p>Docker Engine or rootful Podman through the same command/socket contract.</p></div>
        <div class="runtime-box"><span>HOST NATIVE</span><strong>mypaas-statd</strong><p>systemd + Unix socket · cgroup v2 telemetry.</p></div>
        <div class="runtime-box"><span>PROJECT OUTPUT</span><strong>Containers</strong><p>Dockerfile · Compose · public OCI image.</p></div>
        <div class="runtime-box"><span>PROJECT OUTPUT</span><strong>Static release</strong><p>Atomic files served directly by Caddy.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
.blueprint{width:min(calc(100% - 2rem),var(--page-width));margin:0 auto;padding:3rem 0;border-top:1px solid var(--app-border-strong)}.blueprint-head{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr minmax(20rem,.72fr);gap:3.5rem;align-items:end;margin-bottom:1.5rem}.eyebrow,.node span,.host-title span,.runtime-box>span{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--app-subtle)}h2{max-width:15ch;margin:.65rem 0 0;color:var(--app-ink);font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:clamp(2.3rem,4vw,3.8rem);font-weight:560;line-height:.95;letter-spacing:-.035em}.blueprint-head p{margin:0;color:var(--app-muted);font-size:1rem;line-height:1.6}.diagram{position:relative;padding:1rem;border:1px solid var(--app-border-strong);background-color:var(--app-bg);background-image:linear-gradient(var(--app-border) 1px,transparent 1px),linear-gradient(90deg,var(--app-border) 1px,transparent 1px);background-size:28px 28px}.external-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) 5rem minmax(0,1fr);align-items:center;margin-bottom:1rem}.node{background:var(--app-surface)}.external{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.8rem;min-height:5rem;padding:.85rem 1rem;border:1px solid var(--app-border-strong)}.external svg,.panel svg,.host-title svg,.runtime-title svg{width:1.3rem;height:1.3rem;flex:0 0 auto}.external svg,.brand-icon,.runtime-title svg{fill:var(--brand)}.external>div{display:grid;gap:.08rem}.external strong{font-size:1rem}.external small{color:var(--app-muted);font-size:.78rem}.wire-label{position:relative;color:var(--app-subtle);font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:.62rem;text-align:center;text-transform:uppercase}.wire-label::before,.wire-label::after{position:absolute;top:50%;width:1.1rem;height:1px;background:var(--app-border-strong);content:""}.wire-label::before{left:.2rem}.wire-label::after{right:.2rem}.control-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1.1fr 1fr;gap:1px;border:1px solid var(--app-border-strong);background:var(--app-border-strong)}.panel,.automation,.ingress{min-height:8rem;padding:1rem}.panel{display:grid;align-content:start;gap:.32rem}.panel.primary{background:var(--app-ink);color:var(--app-bg)}.panel strong,.automation strong,.ingress strong{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:1.3rem;font-weight:560}.panel small,.automation small,.ingress small{color:var(--app-muted);font-size:.8rem;line-height:1.45}.panel.primary span,.panel.primary small{color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--app-bg) 68%,transparent)}.automation{grid-column:1/3;display:grid;align-content:center;gap:.3rem}.ingress{display:grid;align-content:center;gap:.3rem}.ingress .brand-icon{width:1.25rem;height:1.25rem}.host-shell{margin-top:1rem;border:1px solid var(--app-border-strong);background:var(--app-surface)}.host-title{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.7rem;padding:.8rem 1rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--app-border-strong)}.host-title svg{fill:var(--app-ink)}.host-title>div{display:grid;gap:.08rem}.host-title strong{font-size:.9rem}.runtime-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.25fr .8fr 1fr 1fr;gap:1px;background:var(--app-border)}.runtime-box{min-height:8.3rem;padding:1rem;background:var(--app-surface)}.runtime-title{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.55rem}.runtime-box strong{display:block;margin:.35rem 0;font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:560}.runtime-box p{margin:.35rem 0 0;color:var(--app-muted);font-size:.8rem;line-height:1.48}
@media(max-width:840px){.blueprint-head{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:1rem}.control-grid,.runtime-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.automation{grid-column:1/-1}.ingress{grid-column:1/-1}.runtime-grid>.runtime-box:first-child{grid-column:1/-1}}
@media(max-width:560px){.blueprint{width:min(calc(100% - 1.25rem),var(--page-width));padding:2.4rem 0}.diagram{padding:.65rem}.external-row{grid-template-columns:1fr}.wire-label{height:1.5rem;display:grid;place-items:center}.wire-label::before,.wire-label::after{display:none}.control-grid,.runtime-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.automation,.ingress,.runtime-grid>.runtime-box:first-child{grid-column:auto}.panel,.automation,.ingress,.runtime-box{min-height:auto}.blueprint-head p{font-size:.94rem}}
</style>
